{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLEASE NOTE: The current demo does not offer you any story. The demo us purely gameplay focused. A demo with story will be released during Gamescom 2025.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>What does the game offer?</strong> \ud83c\udfb6</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous puzzles to solve inside a music box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A calming soundtrack to enjoy, composed by Jamal Green.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An emotional story to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy low poly art (including a cute swan!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 A Short Description \ud83c\udfb6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swan Song is a relaxing puzzle game about music, family &amp; loss. Program the music box using all different shapes and sizes of notes, and solve all it's puzzles. Uncover the tragic story behind the box, it's maker and his family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/SwanSong_Gameplay_001.gif?t=1751453473\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 How does it work? \ud83c\udfb6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You solve puzzles by placing notes on your musical scale. After cranking the box, these notes will activate certain platforms when your composition is played. Play them in the right order, and your little swan will make it safely to the exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/SwanSong_Gameplay_002.gif?t=1751453473\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 The Story \ud83c\udfb6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You come across a small music box. Inside it you find all sorts of artifacts belonging to it's maker. This box was his<strong> Swan Song</strong> and most beloved piece, dedicated to his family. By solving the puzzles inside, you will slowly uncover pieces of his story and discover the true meaning behind the box and it's contents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/SwanSong_Story_001.gif?t=1751453473\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3265290?t=1751453473","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751453473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/80b5c39af67d5f61c28fc2281d4e46b7658b3396/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751453473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/80b5c39af67d5f61c28fc2281d4e46b7658b3396/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751453473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3406030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLEASE NOTE: The current demo does not offer you any story. The demo us purely gameplay focused. A demo with story will be released during Gamescom 2025.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>What does the game offer?</strong> \ud83c\udfb6</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous puzzles to solve inside a music box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A calming soundtrack to enjoy, composed by Jamal Green.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An emotional story to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy low poly art (including a cute swan!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 A Short Description \ud83c\udfb6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swan Song is a relaxing puzzle game about music, family &amp; loss. Program the music box using all different shapes and sizes of notes, and solve all it's puzzles. Uncover the tragic story behind the box, it's maker and his family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/SwanSong_Gameplay_001.gif?t=1751453473\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 How does it work? \ud83c\udfb6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You solve puzzles by placing notes on your musical scale. After cranking the box, these notes will activate certain platforms when your composition is played. Play them in the right order, and your little swan will make it safely to the exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/SwanSong_Gameplay_002.gif?t=1751453473\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 The Story \ud83c\udfb6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You come across a small music box. Inside it you find all sorts of artifacts belonging to it's maker. This box was his<strong> Swan Song</strong> and most beloved piece, dedicated to his family. By solving the puzzles inside, you will slowly uncover pieces of his story and discover the true meaning behind the box and it's contents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/SwanSong_Story_001.gif?t=1751453473\" /></div></p>","developers":["Business Goose Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/f52ebd0967e3f37be4489459d7cf3f11e2abd768/header.jpg?t=1751